#!/bin/bash

# omarchy:summary=Boot splash theme (declarative on OmniXY)
# omarchy:hidden=true

cat <<'MSG'
On OmniXY the boot splash is part of the NixOS configuration. Omarchy's theme
is installed as `omarchy` when omnixy.features.plymouth is true:

  boot.plymouth.theme = "omarchy";

Set another installed theme there, then run omarchy-update.
MSG
